---
// 404 fallback redirection to /en/ for static routing misses
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Redirecting...</title>
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace('/en/');
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Redirecting... <a href="/en/">click here</a> if not redirected automatically.</p>
  </body>
</html>
